Any time one of your minions dies or expires, and even if it is resurrected by a boneyard, the dread feeds on it.

Each time it feeds it gets healed for [130, 172, 205, 232, 257 (TL1-5; SP 100)] and reduces remaining cooldown of its spells by [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)].

Every 10 minion deaths it casts a random hex on up to [2, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] foes at once, instantly and without triggering a cooldown.
